# Build-context filter for docker/helios-ai-api.Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# The image needs: src/ (sources only), config/*.json, nuget.config, docker/.
# Root-level-only patterns (no leading **/) deliberately do not touch nested
# files — e.g. `*.txt` skips the root build logs but keeps src/**/CMakeLists.txt.

# --- VCS / tooling metadata ---
.git
.github
.claude
.devcontainer
.vscode

# --- Runtime state: mounted as a volume, never baked into the image ---
.helios
**/.helios

# --- Build outputs and caches (also keeps host obj/ from clobbering the
# --- in-container restore, and stale host CMake caches from breaking cmake) ---
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
src/ai/HELIOS.AIHub.Native/build

# --- Heavy trees the image never needs ---
infra
docs
tests
builds
submodules
installer
scripts
tools
phases
components
dashboards
demos
examples
monitoring
plugins
samples
microsoft-ecosystem
file-architecture
cloud-integration
ai-integration
HELIOS
HELIOS-Platform-Portable
HELIOS.Platform.Installer
HELIOS.Platform.ShellExtension
HELIOS.Platform.SystemIntegration
HELIOS.Platform.Tray

# --- Root-level noise (status docs, build logs, stray sources) ---
*.md
*.txt
*.log
*.sql
*.ps1
*.cs
*.sln
*.csproj
*.code-workspace
_config.yml
azure-pipelines.yml
security.config.template.json
verify-documentation-testing.sh
verify-setup.sh
docker-compose.yml
